  "limits": [
    "LD stall2 is sufficient only in the tested configurations; no hardware minimum or formal ABI is claimed.",
    "The matching dependency wait establishes safe result consumption, not GO acceptance or CLOSE resource-release time.",
    "Admission traces prove other requests start and finish during a held connection gap; they do not prove simultaneous residency of all requests or count internal tickets.",
    "Trace timestamps and dependent FADDs are outside MF bodies; these controls do not test cross-warp instruction interleaving inside one fused body.",
    "Unsafe multi-iteration loops may restore input before prior return writes complete and corrupt later queries. Single-request negative controls isolate the immediate-consumer error; identical-ray loops cannot alone exclude reuse of a prior iteration result."
